<title>USA: Hillsdale Cty, Mich., won by County National Bank.</title>
<headline>Hillsdale Cty, Mich., won by County National Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>County National Bank of Hillsdale said it won $1.870 million of Hillsdale County, Mich., general obligation taxable limited tax notes, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 6.4135 percent.</p>
</text>
